<title>HONG KONG: Proview International HK IPO 116 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Proview International HK IPO 116 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Proview International Holdings Ltd said on Monday its offering of 117 million shares in Hong Kong was about 116 times subscribed.</p>
<p>All of the additional 13 million shares offered on a preferential basis to employees had been applied for, it added.</p>
<p>Proview offered a total 130 million new shares at HK$1.12 each in an initial public offering.</p>
<p>The stock is due to make its market debut on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Proview designs, makes and sells computer monitors.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
